+# The arm64 half. hevc/dsp.c:262 and hevc/pred.c:82 call
+# ff_hevc_dsp_init_aarch64 and ff_hevc_pred_init_aarch64 unconditionally under
+# ARCH_AARCH64, so these are required rather than optional, and the set is the
+# nine objects libavcodec/aarch64/Makefile lists for CONFIG_HEVC_DECODER --
